  "categorias": "Economía|Noticias|Política|Sociedad",
  "post_content": "<p>147 fotos de la &uacute;ltima jornada, el domingo, de la Fira de Sant Miguel de Onda, con la cuestaci&oacute;n de la Asociaci&oacute;n Castell&oacute;n contra el C&aacute;ncer (ACCC), m&aacute;s F&uacute;tbol 3x3, la globotraca o la actuaci&oacute;n de Castell&oacute;n Baila, trasladada por la amenaza de lluvia al M&oacute;naco, como <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=59024\" target=\"_blank\">el desfile de 5 Lobitos (reportaje aparte)</a>.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/IMG_4178.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Adem&aacute;s de la continuaci&oacute;n de la Oktoberfest, organizada por Hosturionda, Lluna Estilistes ha sorteado un a&ntilde;o de peluquer&iacute;a gratis, que le ha correspondido a Mar&iacute;a Jos&eacute; Mas Gresa.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengefirasantmiquel15/p1170964.jpg\" alt=\"p1170964\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengefirasantmiquel15/p1170968.jpg\" alt=\"p1170968\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengefirasantmiquel15/p1170970.jpg\" alt=\"p1170970\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengefirasantmiquel15/p1170971.jpg\" alt=\"p1170971\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengefirasantmiquel15/p1170975.jpg\" alt=\"p1170975\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengefirasantmiquel15/p1170976.jpg\" alt=\"p1170976\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diumengefirasantmiquel15/p1170978